 2rem"><div><h4 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600">About <!-- -->Geometry Dash Lite</h4><p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Your home for Geometry Dash Lite and the best rhythm platformer games online. Play Geometry Dash, Meltdown, SubZero, Slope, Run 3, and hundreds more — free, no download required!</p></div><div><h4 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600">Top Categories</h4><ul class="footer-links" style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0"><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/category/featured" data-discover="true">Featured Games</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/category/skill" data-discover="true">Skill Games</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/category/arcade" data-discover="true">Arcade Games</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/category/running" data-discover="true">Running Games</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/category/action" data-discover="true">Action Games</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600">Popular Games</h4><ul class="footer-links" style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0"><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/geometry-dash" data-discover="true">Geometry Dash</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/geometry-dash-meltdown" data-discover="true">Geometry Dash Meltdown</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/geometry-dash-subzero" data-discover="true">Geometry Dash SubZero</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/slope" data-discover="true">Slope</a></li><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/run-3" data-discover="true">Run 3</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;font-weight:600">Information</h4><ul class="footer-links" style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0"><li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><a href="/privacy" data-discover="true">common.privacy</a></li><li style="margin-bottom